{"Lua-incapacitation-destroy-airfields":"Destroy all airfields and helipads.","Lua-incapacitation-destroy-aa":"Destroy or disable all air defense structures.","Lua-incapacitation-tip-intruders":"Intruders can teleport short distances using either the deploy command [{0}] or force move (they can be teleported as a group).","Lua-incapacitation-tip-leechers-heal":"Leechers can be deployed using [{0}] to temporarily transform into balls of bio-matter which heal nearby allies.","Lua-incapacitation-tip-leechers-death":"Leechers also transform in this way to avoid death and attempt to regenerate. In either case they are vulnerable in this state.","Lua-incapacitation-dangerous-unit":"Dangerous unit patrolling. Evasion recommended. Press {0} to view.","Lua-incapacitation-aa-remaining":"{0} active anti-aircraft defenses remaining. {1} aircraft structures remaining.","Lua-incapacitation-leecher-inbound":"Leecher arriving in 20 seconds.","Lua-incapacitation-intruder-inbound":"Intruder arriving in 20 seconds."}
